    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 2 Connolly Terrace is a very, very, special residence for many reasons. Location is fantastic, within walking distance of city centre. Immaculate condition throughout with very high standard of finish throughout. Extremely bright sunny aspect throughout the property. Exceptional off street parking to front. Plus a very attractive low maintenance garden to rear. Double glazed. Electric heating.\n\nNo. 2 comprises, entrance hallway, spacious living room, superb kitchen/ dining room- fully fitted, downstairs shower, WC, and WHB. 4 excellent bedrooms plus superb second bathroom with shower, WC, and WHB.\n\nNo. 2 is ready to walk into. Immaculately presented. Ideal city townhouse due to its prime location for both owner occupiers. Plus, having enormous investment potential.\n\nViewing with John Quinn 091 569 174. \n"
